ealth, death of family members, violence towards children, violence towards animals, evil corporations, gun use, police corruption and prostitution. A corpse is seen. The tone of the game is dark and atmospheric, but the dialogue is often very comedic and the characters often behave in silly ways. The game is rather self-aware and satirical; it doesn’t wallow in the darkness."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "14", "required_age": "14", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drogas ilícitas\nLinguagem imprópria\nViolência"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drastische Gewalt\nDrogen\nDerbe Sprache"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Penggunaan bahasa\nRokok dan/atau rokok elektronik, minuman beralkohol, narkotika, psikotropika, dan/atau zat adiktif lainnya\nKekerasan"}}}}}